<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-001" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0002" ref="48e_04a_3d8">濬沖</persName>，琅邪人，太保<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>宗族也。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0016" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI">文皇帝</persName>輔政，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0022" ref="a6a_4c2_670">鍾會</persName>薦之曰：『<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0029" ref="530_f9d_4bd">裴楷</persName>淸通，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:zhugong:m0034" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>簡要。』即倶辟爲掾。晉踐祚，累遷荊州刺史，以平呉功，封安豐侯。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>爲豫州刺史，遭母憂，性至孝，不拘禮制，飲酒食肉，或觀棊弈，而容貌毀悴，杖而後起。時汝南<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu:m0044" ref="3fc_362_06e">和嶠</persName>，亦名士也，以禮法自持。處大憂，量米而食，然憔悴哀毀，不逮<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu:m0075" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>也。</p>
</text>
